---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Swim BASI | Our Story"
  description="Meet Swim BASI, a women's swimwear brand built around confidence, expressive color, and strong silhouettes."
  ><section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'About' }]} /><p class="eyebrow">
        Our story
      </p><h1>For women who embody confidence.</h1>
    </div>
  </section><section class="content-page wrap">
    <article class="prose">
      <p class="notice">
        <strong>Brand story placeholder:</strong> Replace this copy with the founder-approved Swim BASI
        story before launch.
      </p><p>
        Swim BASI begins with a simple belief: confidence should be seen. Every color and silhouette
        is presented to help women feel expressive, present, and entirely themselves.
      </p><h2>Color with intention</h2><p>
        Our visual world is bold without becoming loud—an evolving edit of color, form, and seasonal
        energy.
      </p><h2>Designed to make an entrance</h2><p>
        From streamlined one-pieces to expressive bikinis, Swim BASI celebrates silhouettes that
        hold their own.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section></BaseLayout
>
